# ISAAI session phases

Follow [MASTER_PROMPT.md](../MASTER_PROMPT.md).

- Default: **P0–P2 text only** (markdown, HTML, BPMN, ArchiMate XML).
- **Never** batch-read `*.png`, `*.jpg`, or `*.jpeg`.
- **Never** attach or read images from outside this repo in the same turn.
- Max **2 images per request**, **8 per session**; paths must be listed in `docs/AI-SESSION-IMAGE-INDEX.md`.
- Prefer `.bpmn` / `.archimate` over diagram exports.
- Use censored stakeholder filenames (`STAKEHOLDER-*`), not `[JP]*` prefixes in new files.
